This instruction was only created by SimplifyCFG when it could pattern match tests like : 

```
enum E : Int {
  case E0 = 0
  case E1 = 1
  case E2 = 2
  case E3 = 3
}

func makeE(a: Int) -> E {
  return E.fromRaw(a)!
}

```

We don't need this anymore since LLVM is able to optimize without it.

